# Copy to .env.local for local development, and set the same two in Vercel.
# Leave both unset and the app runs entirely in this browser — no auth, no network.
#
# Both come from the Supabase dashboard: Project Settings -> API.
# The anon key is meant to be public; row-level security is what protects the
# data. Never put the service_role key here — it bypasses every policy.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
